OL,3,ANext data accessed in cyber breach     
OL,5,FNext has said that some of its data has
OL,6,Fbeen accessed in a cyber breach        
OL,7,Faffecting a third-party online         
OL,8,Fsupplier.                              
OL,10,FThe high street retailer said there was
OL,11,Fno evidence that customers' personal   
OL,12,Fdata had been compromised.             
OL,14,FThe firm - which has its headquarters  
OL,15,Fin Enderby, Leicestershire - said it   
OL,16,Fhad been informed by one of its        
OL,17,Fsuppliers about the incident, which led
OL,18,Fto "unauthorised access to certain     
OL,19,Fbenign data relating to Next".         
